1
00:00:00,860 --> 00:00:08,080
People closest to a crisis often see it coming first. ACAPS Community lets them say so.

2
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:14,100
Experts apply on the website, and ACAPS approves each one to keep panels trusted.

3
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:21,700
Members get risks matching their country or field. Swipe to save or skip, tap for triggers.

4
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:29,480
Answering takes only a minute: agree or disagree, how likely it is, and what you see on the ground.

5
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:33,100
You choose how private your identity is.

6
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:37,120
Nothing is ever shown to the public if you choose so.

7
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:43,020
You only see others’ answers after giving yours.

8
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:48,680
In the final result, experts from that country and field count most.

9
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:52,920
Resolved forecasts build a track record.

10
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:58,940
The most accurate experts rise to the top and receive certificates.

11
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:09,000
ACAPS gets one platform to approve experts, publish risks and see every panel’s view in one place.

12
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:16,240
ACAPS Community. Ground truth you can trust. Risks you can forecast.
